
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Shipment Confirmed - SwiftDrop</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7f9;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #0f766e;
      padding: 28px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .header-text {
      color: #d1fae5;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 8px 0 0;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 30px;
    }

    .success-icon {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      line-height: 60px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #dcfce7;
      color: #15803d;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .intro {
      text-align: center;
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .details {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .detail-row {
      display: table;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 9px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .label,
    .value {
      display: table-cell;
      font-size: 14px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .label {
      width: 42%;
      color: #6b7280;
    }

    .value {
      color: #111827;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .status {
      color: #15803d;
    }

    .message {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 16px;
      background-color: #ecfdf5;
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #065f46;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 22px 30px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      text-align: center;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer strong {
      color: #374151;
    }
  </style>

</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

```
<div class="header">
  <h2 class="logo">SwiftDrop</h2>
  <p class="header-text">Merchant-Focused Courier & Logistics Platform</p>
</div>

<div class="content">

  <div class="success-icon">✓</div>

  <h1>Shipment Confirmed Successfully</h1>

  <p class="intro">
    Hello <strong><%= merchantName %></strong>,
    <br />
    your shipment payment has been successfully confirmed.
    Your shipment is now ready for the next stage of delivery.
  </p>

  <div class="details">

    <div class="detail-row">
      <span class="label">Tracking ID</span>
      <span class="value"><%= trackingId %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-row">
      <span class="label">Recipient</span>
      <span class="value"><%= recipientName %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-row">
      <span class="label">Delivery Fee</span>
      <span class="value">৳ <%= deliveryFee %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-row">
      <span class="label">Payment Status</span>
      <span class="value status">PAID</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-row">
      <span class="label">Shipment Status</span>
      <span class="value status">PAYMENT CONFIRMED</span>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="message">
    <strong>What's next?</strong><br />
    Our operations team will assign a rider to your shipment.
    You can use the tracking ID to monitor your shipment progress.
  </div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
  <strong>SwiftDrop</strong><br />
  Reliable delivery. Simple logistics.<br /><br />
  This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
</div>
```

  </div>
</body>
</html>
